              "marks": [
                "n0edh5vsolkv"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "gyye1dsexivi",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Grand Aquarium"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "n0edh5vsolkv",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nestled in the northern part of Hurghada, in the area known as Ad-Dahar, the Hurghada Grand Aquarium is a gateway to the marine universe of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "the Red Sea"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". For those who have experienced the underwater world through snorkeling or diving, this aquarium serves as a fascinating resource to learn more about the aquatic life encountered."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/explore-egypt-and-red-sea/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/11-day-explore-egypt-and-red-sea-tour",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Portal to Marine Education and Conservation "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Hurghada Grand Aquarium isn’t just an exhibit; it’s an educational journey. It strives to inspire visitors of all ages to value and understand the marine environment, emphasizing the critical role of conservation. The facility operates on the belief that education about our oceans is key to conserving them. It fosters a sense of stewardship in both children and adults, teaching the importance of ecological responsibility and encouraging actions that contribute to the preservation of our marine world."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Engaging and Innovative Learning Experiences"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The aquarium "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000e"
              ],
              "text": "offers a diverse range of educational"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " experiences, tailored to kindle curiosity and compassion for aquatic life across all age groups. It stands as a beacon of learning innovation, continually evolving its approach to engage visitors meaningfully with the aquatic world. By implementing best practices and research from global peers, the aquarium not only enhances the visitor experience but also contributes to a broader understanding of marine ecosystems."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/historical-sites-visited-by-a-nile-cruise/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/nairu-kuruzu-de-otozureru-rekishi-iseki",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Glimpse into the Red Sea's Underwater Realm"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "While showing signs of age and in need of some updates, the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000015"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Grand Aquarium still boasts the most comprehensive display of Red Sea marine life in the city. It "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000018"
              ],
              "text": "provides a unique"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " opportunity, especially for non-swimmers, to observe the rich and vibrant fish life of the Red Sea up close."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/group-tour-luxor-hurghada/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/luxor-highlights-group-day-tour-from-hurghada",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/nour-el-nil-assouan-dahabiya/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/nile-cruises/nour-el-nil-assouan-dahabiya",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Location and Accessibility "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Located on the Corniche in the bustling area of Ad-Dahar, the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001f"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Grand Aquarium is easily accessible and stands as a must-visit for anyone eager to delve deeper into the mysteries of the Red Sea’s underwater world."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurghada",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
